flow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于\n            <span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n             El Paraiso 与\n             <span style=\"font-family: Inter, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n              José Ignacio Gómez\n             </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 14px;'>\n          // 下述文字与图片部分来源于咖篮公众号，以及翻译自https://samplecoffee.com.au/coffee/jose-gomez\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Jose的帕莱索农场位于娜玲珑省布埃萨科镇附近的橙村。帕莱索庄园的瑰夏生长在海拔1750到2000米，庄园每年平均降雨量为1800毫米。Jose在一个咖啡农家庭中长大，他的父亲是一个地地道道的咖农，他也从小就有机会接触咖啡，也渐渐地进入了这个产业；2002年，Jose购入了自己的农场开始亲自种植加工咖啡，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          起\n          <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           初还是类似父亲的传统的种植与加工方式，但随着对精品咖啡的认知加深，并在当地的咖农协会从事专业的杯测员工作，Jose慢慢的萌生了改变的想法，随后他与其他几个同样对品质有要求和对精品咖啡市场的未来充满信心的咖农们一起成立了\n          </span>\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Cooperativa de Cafés Especiales de Nariño合作社。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n          帕莱索庄园的咖啡种植面积有6.5公顷，除此之外还栽有橙子，柠檬和牛油果。在采收期，他和他的家人以及经验丰富的采收工会手工采摘成熟的红果，并在庄园自有的小型处理厂进行发酵和湿加工。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxibNbtm7EHUb79MGcjU8upcciaLJRgaqazNDEdjgYHciaR5Na387tBG1UQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 10.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           几年前，\n          </span>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           Jose在庄园的湿处理站旁建造了特制的晾晒房。这样的设计更加适合帕莱索庄园的气候：在塑料棚顶下方布置了三层高架干燥床，使光线可以照进房中，晾晒房两端有开口，可以通过控制开口使风通过，从而控制房内的温度。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 9pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxZD2F59TNhzjcLtCOgCqkJmvw6NOPWErgbSLRQgpFZIOfUePYPUrcAg/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n          El Pa\n         </span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-size: 9pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          raiso 庄园的晒棚\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 10.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          Jose对如何控制干燥温度有自己的一套标准。刚刚采收的鲜果，日晒蜜处理或者水洗都会被在最下层进行干燥，干燥过程中，逐渐往上层转移，直到达到标准的含水率为止，之后移入静置房进入脱壳前的静置期，这样有利于把风味物质更好地保留下来。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QEzxCDcLRUkF58lTSMOdZxCMB35uSdCQTw44O8HDI4DQM82JtwPKC7aN8z5bGfcJykibotrcxfRXw/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";letter-spacing: 0.4pt;font-size: 10.5pt;background-image: initial;background-position: initial;background-size: initial;background-repeat: initial;background-attachment: initial;background-origin: initial;background-clip: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n          Jose一直在为创新的处理方法和更好的产量质量付出努力，他的水洗瑰夏在2020年卓越杯上获得第三名。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-right: 8px;margin-left: 8px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(136, 136, 136);font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei UI\";font-size: 9pt;letter-spacing: 0.4pt;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;display: initial;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
